  <data name="Issues.Import.PromptLabel" xml:space="preserve"><value>Prompt for generating an importable JSON file</value></data>
  <data name="Issues.Import.Prompt" xml:space="preserve"><value>Take our conversation above and turn it into a single JSON file that I can download. Output ONLY the JSON (no extra text, comments, or code fences), and provide it as a downloadable .json file.

Use exactly this structure:
{
  "messages": [
    { "author": "Name", "date": "2026-07-01T14:30:00", "content": "Message text" }
  ]
}

Rules:
- Include every message in the conversation, in the order they appear.
- "messages" is an array.
- "author" is the sender's name (for example, me or you).
- "date" is ISO-8601 (yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss). If a message's time is unknown, omit the "date" field.
- "content" is the full message text. Use \n for line breaks inside a message.</value></data>
